# Patterns the local privacy pre-commit hook refuses in a commit (CLAUDE.md "Public repo").
# Copy to .privacy-patterns (gitignored) and put the real ones there; never commit that file.
# One case-insensitive extended regex (grep -E) per line. # comments and blank lines are ignored.
# Only lines and file names a commit adds are checked.

# Account emails
you@example\.com
# Device serials, personal names, private space or folder names, private hostnames
ABC123SERIAL
my-private-space
